[{"client_msg_id":"63060e5d-9408-40fd-90cb-fb64f456fe0e","type":"message","user":"UQX22KG9F","text":"針が短いからコツがいるとかいうやつでしたっけ？","ts":"1627730643.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9gf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A47D6DF3-3758-4EFF-B1AF-AB8433DD9E79","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえばインスリンの注射針を使えば1瓶から5回じゃなくて6回取れるみたいな話がありましたよね。あれ結局どうなったんだろう。","ts":"1627730254.041900","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1627730272.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F8sH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"365abc12-101f-431b-9e35-b94982d7fede","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"痛くない注射針があるみたい。今回それが使われているのかどうかは知りませんが。\n\u003chttps://intojapanwaraku.com/culture/96976/\u003e","ts":"1627725057.040300","attachments":[{"fallback":"和樂web 日本文化の入り口マガジン: 鋭い刃先で小さく切る！テルモ株式会社の「痛くない注射針」の秘密　｜　和樂web 日本文化の入り口マガジン","id":1,"title":"鋭い刃先で小さく切る！テルモ株式会社の「痛くない注射針」の秘密　｜　和樂web 日本文化の入り口マガジン","title_link":"https://intojapanwaraku.com/culture/96976/","text":"年間1000回以上――。糖尿病患者が治療のために打つ注射の回数です。血糖の状態を安定させるためにはインスリンを1日に数回（多い時は4～5回）注射せねばなりません。ですから、年間では単純計算でも軽く1000回を超えてしまうのです。 注射器はたいてい、薬剤などを入れる筒の部分と注射針とでできています。体内に薬を入れたり、血管から血を抜いたりするときに欠かせない医療機器です。しかし、針を刺される際の痛み...","image_url":"https://intojapanwaraku.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/nanotop2.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"和樂web 日本文化の入り口マガジン","service_icon":"https://intojapanwaraku.com/wp-content/themes/warakuweb/assets/img/favicon2.png","from_url":"https://intojapanwaraku.com/culture/96976/","original_url":"https://intojapanwaraku.com/culture/96976/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f1e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b3f2681-2e6b-4fb5-96e8-6381b90e57a7","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"1回目はチクッとしたのですが、2回目は全く痛くなかったですね。","ts":"1627724591.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"34PJE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90772AE1-85CC-46B2-9110-852A60CE20E2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"横流しはさすがにしてないと思うけど、刺して押してないがこの人だけなのは、いくらなんでもピンポイント過ぎではというw","ts":"1627721497.038500","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1627721515.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGme"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2f0314e-58f0-4559-9fa1-8c12338cff0b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"一回誰かに刺した注射器に入っていた液体とか絶対イヤだｗ","ts":"1627720821.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r2GJT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81c7879b-8422-45fb-83fb-3a7680094118","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"横流ししたいなら生理食塩水打って、本物はそのまま横流しすればいいだけだし","ts":"1627720763.035300","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1627720778.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a486da4a-a1b9-401f-a2bf-323c4160ddf7","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"偶然でしょう。メリットないし","ts":"1627720746.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e73d16f9-7677-4d7d-b7cc-8ae945ca0547","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"うーん","ts":"1627720663.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KvG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e17ec5cb-9f00-490a-b1f0-16f2e8f08eca","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"たまたまこの人だけっていう話ですけどね","ts":"1627720569.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HfJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id"